To get a real downloadable APK, you have these options:

OPTION 1: Download from a file hosting service
- Google Drive
- Dropbox  
- GitHub Releases (once build succeeds)

OPTION 2: Use online APK builder
- Go to https://www.appsforall.com/android-app-builder
- Or use https://buildozer.readthedocs.io/en/latest/

OPTION 3: Get help from the community
- Post on Stack Overflow Android tag
- Ask in Android subreddits
- Contact a local Android developer

OPTION 4: Wait for automated build
- Check GitHub Actions page
- Wait for build to complete
- Download from Releases

